          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="2ecd-b4ff-9e78-a8e2">Add +1 DICE to the Risky Success Roll for a War Wolf that is taking a Dash ACTION. In addition, a War Wolf ignores the penalty for moving through Difficult terrain (other terrain affects it normally).</characteristic>
