                <characteristic name="Range" typeId="2b32-2f45-9c06-7a77"/>
                <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="5093-5528-b08f-1496">HELD, LEADER</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Rules" typeId="4834-43a9-1c93-9062">Kneel Before Me: An enemy model that is Down and within 1&quot; of a model with the Standard of Mammon cannot stand back up. In addition, the opposing player must take a Success Roll for any of their models that finish a charge within 1&quot; of a model with the Standard of Mammon. If the roll is a Failure, the enemy model is marked as being Down. If the roll is a Success or a Critical Success, the enemy model stays on its feet.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </selectionEntry>
      </selectionEntries>
